      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Invisible mode, the perfect, least friction, way to cheat in VRC relationships. This surely won't be abused...     At least the current method of having an alt account has friction that makes it less likely to be used. No thanks.\n\nFriends that bug friends when they use DND, even after expressing to them that you don't appreciate being bothered about using DND, aren't good friends at all, and the entire platform shouldn't need to suffer as a whole just because some people are too timid to call friends out when they try to shame or bug you over utilizing DND.\n\nI've had zero issue with using DND with a custom status message so people know to leave me alone if I need away time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
